      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm a mid-sized manufacturing owner in ohio and i've got a meeting with some local reps next week about these new carbon emission standards being pushed. i need to make a strong case for why these are gonna hurt us. can you give me a list of solid arguments against these new regulations that i can use in my presentation? focus on the economic impact and the practical side of things for a factory like mine. weight the",
